#: ../../openmvcam/quickref.rst:4
msgid "OpenMV Boards"
msgstr "Placas OpenMV"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref.rst:6
msgid ""
"OpenMV cameras and Arduino boards running OpenMV firmware. Each page has the"
" full pinout, peripheral mapping, supported drivers, and board-specific "
"notes."
msgstr ""
"Câmaras OpenMV e placas Arduino com firmware OpenMV. Cada página apresenta o"
" diagrama de pinos completo, mapeamento de periféricos, controladores "
"suportados e notas específicas da placa."

